title: AWS Application Load Balancer: LCUs (v2)
agents: aws_v2
catalog: cloud/aws
license: GPLv2
distribution: check_mk
description:
 This check monitors the number of load balancer capacity units
 consumed by AWS/ApplicationELB services.

 To make this check work you have to configure the related
 special agent {{Amazon Web Services (AWS) v2}}.

 No default levels are set. Upper levels can be configured.

discovery:
 One service is created if all required metrics (ConsumedLCUs) are given.
